📊 Statistical Analysis of Poverty in Central Java 2020
Project Description:
This project presents a statistical analysis of poverty data across regencies and cities in Central Java in 2020 using data from Statistics Indonesia (BPS).
The analysis was conducted to examine:

The number of poor residents in each region:
Poverty rates across regencies and cities
Poverty data proportions
Data variance (S²)
Differences in poverty levels among regions

Project Objectives:
Analyze poverty conditions in Central Java in 2020.
Compare poverty levels among regencies and cities.
Identify regions with the highest and lowest poverty levels.
Develop statistical data analysis skills using Microsoft Excel.
Understand the distribution and variation of poverty across regions.

